    skos:prefLabel "3 Schedule(s)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-3 ;
    values:originalText "Subject to section 2, each Act that is specified in a Schedule to this Act is amended or repealed as set out in the applicable items in the Schedule concerned, and any other item in a Schedule to this Act has effect according to its terms.   Repeal  Schedule 1  Financial Sector (Collection of Data—Consequential and Transitional Provisions) Act 2001                   3" ;
