concept:financial-sector-collection-of-data-consequential-and-transitional-provisions-act-2001-sch-2-sec-57 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "57 Determination as to confidentiality"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-57 ;
    values:originalText "(1) APRA may determine whether a document that was given to APRA by a registered entity, or by a body regulated by APRA, under section 13 of the Financial Sector (Collection of Data) Act 2001 contains confidential information, but must not make such a determination unless APRA has:  (a) given to the entity or body, or to an association or other body representing the class of entities or bodies within which the entity or body is included, a reasonable opportunity to make representations as to whether information of the kind contained in the document is confidential; and  (b) taken any such representations into account.  (2) A determination made under subsection (1) is a disallowable instrument for the purposes of section 46A of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901.  Amendments  Schedule 2 Banking Act 1959  Part 2  Financial Sector (Collection of Data—Consequential and Transitional Provisions) Act 2001                   7" ;
    skos:definition "(1) APRA may determine whether a document that was given to APRA by a registered entity, or by a body regulated by APRA, under section 13 of the Financial Sector (Collection of Data) Act 2001 contains confidential information, but must not make such a determination unless APRA has:  (a) given to the entity or body, or to an association or other body representing the class of entities or bodies within which the entity or body is included, a reasonable opportunity to make representations as to whether information of the kind contained in the document is confidential; and  (b) taken any such representations into account.  (2) A determination made under subsection (1) is a disallowable instrument for the purposes of section 46A of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901.  Amendments  Schedule 2 Banking Act 1959  Part 2  Financial Sector (Collection of Data—Consequential and Transitional Provisions) Act 2001                   7"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "6c2a2bde14a9c76f60007c715f95fd080ab524a09a0507e1dd747a40a8de591f" ;
    cof:pageNumber "10"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:financial-sector-collection-of-data-consequential-and-transitional-provisions-act-2001-sch-2-sec-57-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:financial-sector-collection-of-data-consequential-and-transitional-provisions-act-2001-sch-2-sec-57-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <financial-sector-collection-of-data-consequential-and-transitional-provisions-act-2001.pdf> ;
    dc:source "financial-sector-collection-of-data-consequential-and-transitional-provisions-act-2001.pdf, p.10" .
