concept:financial-sector-collection-of-data-consequential-and-transitional-provisions-act-2001-sch-2-sec-8-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "8 Financial Sector (Collection of Data—Consequential and Transitional"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-8-2 ;
    values:originalText "Provisions) Act 2001  (a) ADIs; and  (b) authorised NOHCs; and  (c) subsidiaries of ADIs; and  (d) subsidiaries of authorised NOHCs. (3) Expressions used in subitem (2) have the same meanings as in the Banking Act 1959.  Amendments  Schedule 2 Insurance Act 1973  Part 3  Financial Sector (Collection of Data—Consequential and Transitional Provisions) Act 2001                   9" ;
    skos:definition "Provisions) Act 2001  (a) ADIs; and  (b) authorised NOHCs; and  (c) subsidiaries of ADIs; and  (d) subsidiaries of authorised NOHCs. (3) Expressions used in subitem (2) have the same meanings as in the Banking Act 1959.  Amendments  Schedule 2 Insurance Act 1973  Part 3  Financial Sector (Collection of Data—Consequential and Transitional Provisions) Act 2001                   9"@en ;
