    skos:prefLabel "21 Subsection 3(1) (definition of statutory accounts)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-21 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the definition, substitute: statutory accounts, in relation to a body corporate, means the reporting documents that the body corporate is required under section 13 of the Financial Sector (Collection of Data) Act 2001 to lodge with APRA." ;
