    skos:prefLabel "84 Subsections 44(3) and (4)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-84 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the subsections, substitute:  Amendments  Schedule 2 Retirement Savings Accounts Act 1997  Part 5  Financial Sector (Collection of Data—Consequential and Transitional Provisions) Act 2001                   17 Endorsement of report on return  (4) If the return given under the Financial Sector (Collection of Data) Act 2001 is not given on a data processing device, or by way of electronic transmission, the report referred to in subsection (1) may be endorsed on the return." ;
