concept:financial-sector-collection-of-data-consequential-and-transitional-provisions-act-2001-sch-2-sec-132a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "132A Before paragraph 113(3)(a)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-132a ;
    values:originalText "Insert:  (aa) must, if it is approved for a superannuation entity that is not a self managed superannuation fund, either:  (i) relate solely to the audit of financial statements given to APRA under the Financial Sector (Collection of Data) Act 2001 and prepared in respect of a year of income; or  (ii) relate not only to the audit of those statements, but also to the audit of such other accounts and statements, prepared in respect of a year of income, as are identified in the form; and" ;
    skos:definition "Insert:  (aa) must, if it is approved for a superannuation entity that is not a self managed superannuation fund, either:  (i) relate solely to the audit of financial statements given to APRA under the Financial Sector (Collection of Data) Act 2001 and prepared in respect of a year of income; or  (ii) relate not only to the audit of those statements, but also to the audit of such other accounts and statements, prepared in respect of a year of income, as are identified in the form; and"@en ;
