    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-153 ;
    values:originalText "The amendment made by item 152 applies to the payment of levy (within the meaning of the Financial Institutions Supervisory Levies Collection Act 1998) for the financial year beginning on 1 July 2002 and for all subsequent financial years. Income Tax Assessment Act 1936" ;
