    values:originalText "connection with obligations of corporations to register An exemption or determination by the Reserve Bank that was in force immediately before the commencement of this Schedule under paragraph 8(2)(l) of the Financial Corporations Act 1974 continues to have effect as if it were an exemption or determination by APRA under paragraph 7(2)(j) of the Financial Sector (Collection of Data) Act 2001." ;
    skos:definition "connection with obligations of corporations to register An exemption or determination by the Reserve Bank that was in force immediately before the commencement of this Schedule under paragraph 8(2)(l) of the Financial Corporations Act 1974 continues to have effect as if it were an exemption or determination by APRA under paragraph 7(2)(j) of the Financial Sector (Collection of Data) Act 2001."@en ;
