concept:financial-sector-collection-of-data-consequential-and-transitional-provisions-act-2001-sch-3-sec-2-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "2 Former Register of Corporations"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-2-2 ;
    values:originalText "On the commencement of this Schedule, the Register of Corporations that, immediately before that commencement, was kept by the Reserve Bank under subsection 9(9) of the Financial Corporations Act 1974 continues in existence as the Register of Entities kept by APRA under section 8 of the Financial Sector (Collection of Data) Act 2001." ;
    skos:definition "On the commencement of this Schedule, the Register of Corporations that, immediately before that commencement, was kept by the Reserve Bank under subsection 9(9) of the Financial Corporations Act 1974 continues in existence as the Register of Entities kept by APRA under section 8 of the Financial Sector (Collection of Data) Act 2001."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "e54385195879d410f5e1a9104c0dc7dc25fc7da1816b9af266c21e0b57a06025" ;
